      "id": "msg_0333_R05R0401_Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_WantMeToRaiseMon",
      "en_US": [
        "I run the Day-Care service.\r",
        "Would you like me to raise one of\n",
        "your Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0333_R05R0401_Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_ComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Come again."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0333_R05R0401_Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_OweMeXForMonsReturn",
